    // it (#140); faceless targets AI, FK, DH, EK, DK, AK, the rectangles MN
    // (N,P,M,T) and LO (L,P,O,S), the square ST (R,S,Q,T), and the gnomon
    // UVWg (L,P,M,T,Q,S), reached as {UVW|UVWg} because the arc owns UVW.
