              highlighted: ["DH","EK"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "DH, EK medial", ref: "X.21" }] },
            { text: "Since {AG} and {GD} are commensurable in square only, therefore {AG} is incommensurable in length with {GD}.",
              visible: PAR,
              highlighted: ["AG","DG"] },
            { text: "But {AG} is commensurable in length with {AF}, and {DG} with {EG},",
              visible: PAR,
              highlighted: ["AG","AF","DG","EG"] },
            { text: "therefore {AF} is incommensurable in length with {EG}.",
              visible: PAR,
              highlighted: ["AF","EG"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "AF, EG incommensurable", ref: "X.13" }] },
            { text: "But {AF} is to {EG} as {AI} is to {EK}, therefore {AI} is incommensurable with {EK}.",
